  "notes": {
    "heritage": "The EA81 represents the pinnacle of Subaru's pushrod boxer development. Its simple design and robust construction made it ideal for off-road and harsh-duty applications. Many EA81-powered vehicles have exceeded 300,000 miles with basic maintenance.",
    "off_road_legend": "The EA81 is revered in the off-road community. Its low center of gravity, simple mechanicals, and excellent parts availability make it a favorite for trail builds and rural work vehicles.",
    "dual_range_4wd": "The dual-range 4WD system offered low-range gearing, making these vehicles surprisingly capable off-road despite modest power.",
